user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JNZader","id":127463636,"login":"JNZader","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jw1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JNZader/portfolio-2025/commits/10a38599d2a2f59a18d4b62b59123e0250d11c7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T22:34:47Z","email":"127463636+JNZader@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Javier Zader"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T22:34:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ui): shared-element morphs and directional view transitions (#251)\n\nBuilds on the Next 16.3 ViewTransition model:\n\n- Project card image morphs into the detail hero (and reverses on back)\n  via <ViewTransition name={project-<id>} share=\"morph\" default=\"none\">\n  on both sides of the pair (ProjectCard + ProjectDetail)\n- Directional slides: project/blog cards tagged nav-forward, the projects\n  detail back link tagged nav-back; PageTransition maps transition types\n  to slide classes with default: page-fade preserving the cross-fade for\n  untagged navigations (browser back button, top-level nav)\n- globals.css: nav-forward/nav-back slide rules with --slide-offset,\n  400ms morph group duration, all inside prefers-reduced-motion:\n  no-preference; the existing reduce wildcard covers them\n- types/view-transition.d.ts: add share prop and enter/exit\n  ViewTransitionNameMap object form to the react augmentation\n\nBlog detail intentionally gets no nav-back tag (no back-link UI exists;\nbreadcrumbs stay on the cross-fade default).","tree":{"sha":"93140f47eb969aeb170587d32b14e9e7abaaae11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JNZader/portfolio-2025/git/trees/93140f47eb969aeb170587d32b14e9e7abaaae11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JNZader/portfolio-2025/git/commits/10a38599d2a2f59a18d4b62b59123e0250d11c7a","verification":{"payload":"tree 93140f47eb969aeb170587d32b14e9e7abaaae11\nparent d259fd5ab97bb0f39ac21f307da37ce351ae55b4\nauthor Javier Zader <127463636+JNZader@users.noreply.github.com> 1787006087 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787006087 -0300\n\nfeat(ui): shared-element morphs and directional view transitions (#251)\n\nBuilds on the Next 16.3 ViewTransition model:\n\n- Project card image morphs into the detail hero (and reverses on back)\n  via <ViewTransition name={project-<id>} share=\"morph\" default=\"none\">\n  on both sides of the pair (ProjectCard + ProjectDetail)\n- Directional slides: project/blog cards tagged nav-forward, the projects\n  detail back link tagged nav-back; PageTransition maps transition types\n  to slide classes with default: page-fade preserving the cross-fade for\n  untagged navigations (browser back button, top-level nav)\n- globals.css: nav-forward/nav-back slide rules with --slide-offset,\n  400ms morph group duration, all inside prefers-reduced-motion:\n  no-preference; the existing reduce wildcard covers them\n- types/view-transition.d.ts: add share prop and enter/exit\n  ViewTransitionNameMap object form to the react augmentation\n\nBlog detail intentionally gets no nav-back tag (no back-link UI exists;\nbreadcrumbs stay on the cross-fade default).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqg4yHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3pwQACcQ1xZsusqih0Jro6RWqjoc\nCEP9v/mKnSll407NfQEsjR8/rcRkF8h0BW8fMzqKHnkdSG+zvllEdl7HG9NZD4mF\nnzhPP2sJgsbyURmUz6BAgTBbSDC82zQmYye08ETu5noBeRu5XO93vpq7UVHx/WYb\nt+ZaPGEc81rQAmwAN7AGafB2QEBSXNysm5eVoNWo8sY3nI1HjspAOvNsKRWDtJb8\n4