hub.com/users/JNZader/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JNZader","id":127463636,"login":"JNZader","node_id":"U_kgDOB5jw1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JNZader","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JNZader/portfolio-2025/commits/bba122276eb20e932084ca4d866ce6d940a4b7b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T22:09:52Z","email":"127463636+JNZader@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Javier Zader"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T22:09:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ui): migrate route transitions to React ViewTransition on Next 16.3 (#250)\n\nexperimental.viewTransition was removed in Next 16.3 (vercel/next.js#96098)\nbecause the flag was already inert — nothing in the runtime read it, so the\n::view-transition-*(root) cross-fade CSS was dead code. The App Router bundles\nReact canary with <ViewTransition>, and Link navigations already run inside\nReact.startTransition, so transitions now work with zero config.\n\n- Bump next ^16.2.11 -> ^16.3.0 (resolves 16.3.1)\n- Remove the inert experimental.viewTransition flag from next.config.ts\n- Add components/page-transition.tsx: <ViewTransition enter/exit=\"page-fade\"\n  default=\"none\"> boundary with a runtime passthrough guard for the test\n  runner (vitest resolves stable react@19.2.x, which lacks the export)\n- Wrap the 12 public page.tsx entry points (admin/studio excluded; sobre-mi\n  is a permanentRedirect and renders nothing)\n- Migrate globals.css from ::view-transition-*(root) to class-based\n  ::view-transition-*(.page-fade), preserving the 160ms/220ms timings; add\n  ::view-transition { pointer-events: none }; reduced-motion zeroes durations\n  on all pseudo-elements\n- Add types/view-transition.d.ts module augmentation (canary API not yet in\n  @types/react@19.2.x; marked FORWARD-RISK to delete when it ships natively)","tree":{"sha":"68782bb4b1dbfd96fb2feae09bf6e7755784313c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JNZader/portfolio-2025/git/trees/68782bb4b1dbfd96fb2feae09bf6e7755784313c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JNZader/portfolio-2025/git/commits/bba122276eb20e932084ca4d866ce6d940a4b7b3","verification":{"payload":"tree 68782bb4b1dbfd96fb2feae09bf6e7755784313c\nparent fd4f2dd0ddae8c72dd8c6f7239d9fb19c56dfb73\nauthor Javier Zader <127463636+JNZader@users.noreply.github.com> 1787004592 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787004592 -0300\n\nfeat(ui): migrate route transitions to React ViewTransition on Next 16.3 (#250)\n\nexperimental.viewTransition was removed in Next 16.3 (vercel/next.js#96098)\nbecause the flag was already inert — nothing in the runtime read it, so the\n::view-transition-*(root) cross-fade CSS was dead code. The App Router bundles\nReact canary with <ViewTransition>, and Link navigations already run inside\nReact.startTransition, so transitions now work with zero config.\n\n- Bump next ^16.2.11 -> ^16.3.0 (resolves 16.3.1)\n- Remove the inert experimental.viewTransition flag from next.config.ts\n- Add components/page-transition.tsx: <ViewTransition enter/exit=\"page-fade\"\n  default=\"none\"> boundary with a runtime passthrough guard for the test\n  runner (vitest resolves stable react@19.2.x, which lacks the export)\n- Wrap the 12 public page.tsx entry points (admin/studio excluded; sobre-mi\n  is a permanentRedirect and renders nothing)\n- Migrate globals.css from ::view-transition-*(root) to class-based\n  ::view-transition-*(.page-fade), preserving the 160ms/220ms timings; add\n  ::view-transition { pointer-events: none }; reduced-motion zeroes durations\n  on all pseudo-elements\n- Add types/view-transition.d.ts module augmentation (canary API not yet in\n  @types/react@19.2.x; marked FORWARD-RISK to delete when it ships natively)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqg4awCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAP5kQAKs/CfTm/y4j2IjfeJFGIrh9\n8sS7BlbIQu4Sm2t/J5Lla7HQsQPb7ENE1kIIaR9eBEedaP7OiVLZLpgXt0EBUByc\n5wm5CRcgxCyMduZx1gdvRr5wCqr4041/QnH8AF+Tg4QX1fEKC6BeH4UajF7huL10\nmO+RQz9sIOsgzJrj2e51ldNHy4VEi5ikyb6SkdKBU/dHh34p+nt+9Fz38lV2PkaA\nfhapGTfS/gzy8aPnPzjmdPOknTLXRiLCtcJ8M9oTgJ/6Sp6Ed35IxnyvP3ZgawAB\neDCJ+b3MTapJlJRX9TBJGeqMPxekq1/k+LO42RlRkcl5bO1a0BtKmT/N2ESpyURI\nYtfrcPaWwWQ6wv/6l+0EbAUFtsZB8ORfnCOWXcvsVbDkMDT11s8tPrkulGXVwFsS\nxyJZ+3zUQq4FIjSEgPEjEo1SCEVoHjwGVznEFF2EzgxZyQ8IgTrzMm10fQgzDTna\ndLZhxBcg4aie3cYQ9akJ4kXHTS4/Arv4Ki+ax0sYy3jK90KLjaxdkVnyihfHaX8T\nNU/xZ6ckWTpoWvgi2i01uixGFoOL/TIadWuIw1wuqBZD08z9KDKwmG6qLWesRSJp\n41DbALAiEAcxyHZALY7AvM6PnogeNZZj7rp5JeD4QKvzaDtBQ08xix66Ui53gF08\ngw/5gw97/lZI5EcYWFgv\n=vY5d\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-17T22:09:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us