at-microservices-frontend/git/commits/7fb5047c5da81f0a5a927be620b3f673fa97b6fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/7fb5047c5da81f0a5a927be620b3f673fa97b6fc","node_id":"C_kwDOQRHNuNoAKDdmYjUwNDdjNWRhODFmMGE1YTkyN2JlNjIwYjNmNjczZmE5N2I2ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/692be51e6fe212d59c17716285b2e839049dc85a","sha":"692be51e6fe212d59c17716285b2e839049dc85a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/692be51e6fe212d59c17716285b2e839049dc85a"}],"sha":"7fb5047c5da81f0a5a927be620b3f673fa97b6fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/7fb5047c5da81f0a5a927be620b3f673fa97b6fc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/692be51e6fe212d59c17716285b2e839049dc85a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T13:18:28Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.68","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T13:18:28Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.68","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"message":"chore(security): force patched protobufjs/ws/socket.io-parser via pnpm overrides\n\npnpm audit --prod: 15 vulnerabilities (1 critical protobufjs RCE via\nlibsignal) -> 0. Verified: svelte-check 0/0, 320/320 unit tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24e8be1941df9611807fe24530485ad473d3c914","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/trees/24e8be1941df9611807fe24530485ad473d3c914"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/commits/692be51e6fe212d59c17716285b2e839049dc85a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/692be51e6fe212d59c17716285b2e839049dc85a","node_id":"C_kwDOQRHNuNoAKDY5MmJlNTFlNmZlMjEyZDU5YzE3NzE2Mjg1YjJlODM5MDQ5ZGM4NWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/40ce862115daad4c3e7cc35bb6db4acabcc4588e","sha":"40ce862115daad4c3e7cc35bb6db4acabcc4588e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/40ce862115daad4c3e7cc35bb6db4acabcc4588e"}],"sha":"692be51e6fe212d59c17716285b2e839049dc85a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/692be51e6fe212d59c17716285b2e839049dc85a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/40ce862115daad4c3e7cc35bb6db4acabcc4588e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T10:50:31Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.68","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T10:50:31Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.68","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"message":"feat(design): Sealed Letter redesign — rebrand as Secret\n\nReplace the generic dark-indigo theme with a dual-theme OKLCH design system\n(paper light / candlelight dark), self-hosted Spectral + Hanken Grotesk +\nSpline Sans Mono via @fontsource (CSP font-src self), and a wax-seal motif\n(new Seal.svelte) as the E2EE identity. Rework login/register letterheads,\nchat components (letter-style bubbles, serif correspondent names, mono\ntimestamps), ThemeToggle, NotificationModal; new favicon + manifest; app\nrenamed to Secret. Test suite updated (screenshot baselines, new component\ntests).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3615ed809a510f97438b79b43b195b44ca91108f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/trees/3615ed809a510f97438b79b43b195b44ca91108f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/commits/40ce862115daad4c3e7cc35bb6db4acabcc4588e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/40ce862115daad4c3e7cc35bb6db4acabcc4588e","node_id":"C_kwDOQRHNuNoAKDQwY2U4NjIxMTVkYWFkNGMzZTdjYzM1YmI2ZGI0YWNhYmNjNDU4OGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/ee93828af3a06a393d27df1a3db6d434a079c94b","sha":"ee93828af3a06a393d27df1a3db6d434a079c94b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/ee93828af3a06a393d27df1a3db6d434a079c94b"}],"sha":"40ce862115daad4c3e7cc35bb6db4acabcc4588e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/40ce862115daad4c3e7cc35bb6db4acabcc4588e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/ee93828af3a06a393d27df1a3db6d434a079c94b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T02:20:53Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.6","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T02:20:53Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.6","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"message":"fix(crypto): don''t generate fresh keys when a backup exists but no password\n\nIn initSignalWithRestore, if the server holds an encrypted key backup but\nno password is available to decrypt it (cookie still valid but local keys\nevicted, or a new device without re-login), the old code fell through to\nPath 3 and generated a NEW identity — orphaning the backup (losing all\nprior messages) and overwriting the server prekey bundle.\n\nNow that case returns false (needs re-auth); the chat page already surfaces\n\"please log out and log in again\" on false. Fresh-key generation only runs\nfor a genuinely new identity (no backup AND no local keys).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec1b993680508df7c80359b14c0f704724c0afff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/trees/ec1b993680508df7c80359b14c0f704724c0afff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/commits/ee93828af3a06a393d27df1a3db6d434a079c94b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/ee93828af3a06a393d27df1a3db6d434a079c94b","node_id":"C_kwDOQRHNuNoAKGVlOTM4MjhhZjNhMDZhMzkzZDI3ZGYxYTNkYjZkNDM0YTA3OWM5NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/16286bb322c286faea08fb0ce8e3908e0b9eab64","sha":"16286bb322c286faea08fb0ce8e3908e0b9eab64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/16286bb322c286faea08fb0ce8e3908e0b9eab64"}],"sha":"ee93828af3a06a393d27df1a3db6d434a079c94b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/ee93828af3a06a393d27df1a3db6d434a079c94b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/16286bb322c286faea08fb0ce8e3908e0b9eab64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T03:45:47Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.6","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T03:45:47Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.6","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"message":"fix(crypto): stop caching the login password (P1)\n\nThe login password was stored in sessionStorage under `_ek` as\nbtoa(encodeURIComponent(password)) — trivially reversible, so any XSS\ncould recover the password (the PBKDF2 input for every Signal key AND the\nuser''s login credential), defeating the zero-knowledge E2EE guarantee.\n\nRefresh/tab-reopen continuity does NOT need the password: Signal keys live\nin the persistent IndexedDB store, and initSignalWithRestore \"Path 2\"\nreuses those local keys with no password. The password is only needed when\nlocal keys are absent (new device / cleared storage), where re-auth is\ncorrect — and that no-password path already ran on every tab-reopen\n(sessionStorage clears on close), so this introduces no new code path.\n\n- Remove cacheEncryptionPassword / getCachedEncryptionPassword /\n  clearCachedEncryptionPassword and the `_ek` key from keyEncryption.ts.\n- login/register no longer cache the password; chat passes undefined and\n  relies on the persistent key store (faster too — drops a redundant\n  decrypt+reimport on every refresh).\n- Keep auth.store logout `_ek` removal to scrub stale values from sessions\n  created before this change.\n\nVerified: guard test (no password cache API, no `_ek` written), full\nvitest suite 313/313, svelte-check 0 errors, lint clean.\n\nOut of scope (pre-existing, flagged separately): initSignalWithRestore\n\"Path 3\" generates fresh keys when local keys are absent AND no password —\nif a backend backup exists this can orphan it; should return a\nneeds-reauth state instead. Not changed here to keep this E2EE fix tight.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8abd603c7c6767142ef80dbf282f489ac6c43b9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/trees/8abd603c7c6767142ef80dbf282f489ac6c43b9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/commits/16286bb322c286faea08fb0ce8e3908e0b9eab64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/16286bb322c286faea08fb0ce8e3908e0b9eab64","node_id":"C_kwDOQRHNuNoAKDE2Mjg2YmIzMjJjMjg2ZmFlYTA4ZmIwY2U4ZTM5MDhlMGI5ZWFiNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/32789d1ead553faa4b47690f743b724deb52ea49","sha":"32789d1ead553faa4b47690f743b724deb52ea49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/32789d1ead553faa4b47690f743b724deb52ea49"}],"sha":"16286bb322c286faea08fb0ce8e3908e0b9eab64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/16286bb322c286faea08fb0ce8e3908e0b9eab64"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/32789d1ead553faa4b47690f743b724deb52ea49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T03:14:40Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.6","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T03:14:40Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.6","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"message":"fix(ci): retag pulled image to :latest so frontend deploy is deterministic\n\nEven with --force-recreate, the recreated container landed on :latest\n(stale) because the compose service references :latest and the SHA tag\nrewrite wasn''t taking effect. Retag the freshly pulled :<sha> image to\n:latest before recreating so the deploy deterministically ships the new\nbuild, independent of the sed rewrite or which pipeline (frontend vs\nbackend compose-regen) ran last.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"512fc7e58e032e7a7461cfd7f7bbd21055763f0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/trees/512fc7e58e032e7a7461cfd7f7bbd21055763f0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/commits/32789d1ead553faa4b47690f743b724deb52ea49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/32789d1ead553faa4b47690f743b724deb52ea49","node_id":"C_kwDOQRHNuNoAKDMyNzg5ZDFlYWQ1NTNmYWE0YjQ3NjkwZjc0M2I3MjRkZWI1MmVhNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/23303be3e659552e98310644f28fe1e66227af02","sha":"23303be3e659552e98310644f28fe1e66227af02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/23303be3e659552e98310644f28fe1e66227af02"}],"sha":"32789d1ead553faa4b47690f743b724deb52ea49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/32789d1ead553faa4b47690f743b724deb52ea49"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/23303be3e659552e98310644f28fe1e66227af02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T03:09:07Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.6","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T03:09:07Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.6","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"message":"fix(ci): force-recreate frontend on deploy so new image actually ships\n\nThe deploy job pre-pulled the new image and rewrote the compose tag, but\nthen ran `docker compose up -d --no-deps frontend` behind a `--no-recreate`\n\"blue-green\" step. Compose reported the container \"Running\" and never\nswapped it, so every frontend deploy silently kept the OLD image (the\ncontainer stayed on :latest from months ago) while reporting success.\n\nA real blue-green swap isn''t possible for a single named compose service.\nReplace the no-op dance with `--force-recreate`; the pre-pulled image plus\nthe container''s own healthcheck + restart policy keep downtime to seconds.\n\n(Known minor: the post-deploy health loop calls `wget`, absent from the\nimage, so it can false-positive; the compose healthcheck is authoritative.)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e661a26b44ae8cfe041343250d32c409ca42d501","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/trees/e661a26b44ae8cfe041343250d32c409ca42d501"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/commits/23303be3e659552e98310644f28fe1e66227af02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/23303be3e659552e98310644f28fe1e66227af02","node_id":"C_kwDOQRHNuNoAKDIzMzAzYmUzZTY1OTU1MmU5ODMxMDY0NGYyOGZlMWU2NjIyN2FmMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/25ebe4d736d39a49c9626470a23d969389188105","sha":"25ebe4d736d39a49c9626470a23d969389188105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/25ebe4d736d39a49c9626470a23d969389188105"}],"sha":"23303be3e659552e98310644f28fe1e66227af02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/23303be3e659552e98310644f28fe1e66227af02"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/25ebe4d736d39a49c9626470a23d969389188105/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T02:24:04Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.6","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T02:24:04Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.6","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"message":"fix(frontend): satisfy lint (prettier + consistent-type-imports)\n\nThe master pipeline failed at the Lint step (prettier --check), which\nblocked the frontend build + deploy, so the read-receipts UI never shipped.\n\n- Format src/routes/chat/+page.svelte with prettier.\n- Replace inline import() type with a top-level `import type { ReceiptEvent }`\n  in websocket.service.ts (eslint consistent-type-imports).\n\nVerified locally: prettier --check clean, eslint exit 0, svelte-check 0\nerrors, full vitest suite 311/311 pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"616a1531c1f095b3317f498fcda27367f7784609","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/trees/616a1531c1f095b3317f498fcda27367f7784609"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/commits/25ebe4d736d39a49c9626470a23d969389188105","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/25ebe4d736d39a49c9626470a23d969389188105","node_id":"C_kwDOQRHNuNoAKDI1ZWJlNGQ3MzZkMzlhNDljOTYyNjQ3MGEyM2Q5NjkzODkxODgxMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/8490d8404b0c6d561737c158c4ea5e9f83ecbda3","sha":"8490d8404b0c6d561737c158c4ea5e9f83ecbda3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/8490d8404b0c6d561737c158c4ea5e9f83ecbda3"}],"sha":"25ebe4d736d39a49c9626470a23d969389188105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/25ebe4d736d39a49c9626470a23d969389188105"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/8490d8404b0c6d561737c158c4ea5e9f83ecbda3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T12:21:22Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.6","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T12:21:22Z","email":"troyandrada@192.168.1.6","name":"Christian Troy Andrada"},"message":"feat(frontend): delivery & read receipts UI\n\nWire the new server receipt events into the chat UI:\n\n- websocket.service: onReceipt subscription + sendDelivered/sendMarkRead\n  emitters + messageDelivered/messageRead listeners.\n- Message type: add status (''sent'' | ''delivered'' | ''read'').\n- MessageList: render ✓ / ✓✓ / ✓✓(read) on own messages, with\n  aria-label/title for screen readers.\n- chat page: ack delivery on every inbound message, mark-read over WS\n  when a conversation is opened or a message arrives while viewing it,\n  and update own-message status from inbound receipts.\n\nTests: WS receipt forwarding + emit payloads; existing route mocks\nextended with the new methods. Full suite green (311), svelte-check clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2f72e76cf3240ad7c0bbc89e386503ec2a12d2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/trees/f2f72e76cf3240ad7c0bbc89e386503ec2a12d2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/git/commits/8490d8404b0c6d561737c158c4ea5e9f83ecbda3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/8490d8404b0c6d561737c158c4ea5e9f83ecbda3","node_id":"C_kwDOQRHNuNoAKDg0OTBkODQwNGIwYzZkNTYxNzM3YzE1OGM0ZWE1ZTlmODNlY2JkYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commit/420385f13c3d5f9c0bc17ff44406e08c85b51262","sha":"420385f13c3d5f9c0bc17ff44406e08c85b51262","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/420385f13c3d5f9c0bc17ff44406e08c85b51262"}],"sha":"8490d8404b0c6d561737c158c4ea5e9f83ecbda3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christiantroyandrada/chat-microservices-frontend/commits/8490d8404b0c6d561737c158c4ea5e9f83ecb