el%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/vercel","id":35613825,"login":"vercel[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90MzU2MTM4MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Team-Parashuram/Pixel-art-8-bit/commits/5e1551feb0b260b25b382d2798c85dc14119dbca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-08T17:13:45Z","email":"35613825+vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"vercel[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-08T17:13:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Update dependencies for React Flight RCE advisory (#8)\n\nReact Flight / Next.js RCE Advisory Update - Implementation Report\n\nSUMMARY:\nSuccessfully upgraded Next.js to address the React Flight / Next.js RCE advisory.\n\nPROJECT ANALYSIS:\n- Project Type: Next.js application (using pnpm package manager)\n- Configuration: Single workspace (not a monorepo)\n\nAFFECTED PACKAGES DETECTED:\n✓ next: Previously at 16.0.1 (vulnerable), upgraded to 16.0.7 (patched)\n✗ react-server-dom-webpack: Not used in this project\n✗ react-server-dom-parcel: Not used in this project\n✗ react-server-dom-turbopack: Not used in this project\n\nCHANGES IMPLEMENTED:\n\n1. Modified Files:\n   - package.json: Upgraded next from \"16.0.1\" to \"16.0.7\"\n   - pnpm-lock.yaml: Updated with resolved patched Next.js version and all transitive dependencies\n\nRATIONALE FOR CHANGES:\n\nAccording to the advisory requirements for Next.js projects:\n- Next.js 16.x versions vulnerable to the RCE should be upgraded to 16.0.7\n- The project was using 16.0.1 (vulnerable) and is now on 16.0.7 (patched)\n- React (19.2.0) and react-dom (19.2.0) were NOT manually modified because:\n  - The advisory specifies: \"For Next.js projects, do not manually upgrade react or react-dom. Next.js will supply the correct patched React dependency versions automatically.\"\n  - React and react-dom are not vulnerable themselves; the vulnerability only affects React Flight packages\n  - This project does not use React Flight packages\n\nVERIFICATION:\n- Next.js successfully upgraded from 16.0.1 to 16.0.7\n- pnpm-lock.yaml generated with correct resolved versions\n- No breaking changes to React or react-dom versions\n- Project follows the exact guidance from the advisory\n\nBUILD STATUS:\nReady for build verification. The advisory has been successfully applied to address the identified vulnerability.\n\nCo-authored-by: Vercel <vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"cec8b59c6a2947d9ba4627b8b8e7dbc06026b5cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Team-Parashuram/Pixel-art-8-bit/git/trees/cec8b59c6a2947d9ba4627b8b8e7dbc06026b5cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Team-Parashuram/Pixel-art-8-bit/git/commits/5e1551feb0b260b25b382d2798c85dc14119dbca","verification":{"payload":"tree cec8b59c6a2947d9ba4627b8b8e7dbc06026b5cb\nparent 8a46bfe885b82e73da0b81415e94704f3dfca9bf\nauthor vercel[bot] <35613825+vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1765214025 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1765214025 +0530\n\nUpdate dependencies for React Flight RCE advisory (#8)\n\nReact Flight / Next.js RCE Advisory Update - Implementation Report\n\nSUMMARY:\nSuccessfully upgraded Next.js to address the React Flight / Next.js RCE advisory.\n\n