/repos/Nguyen-Tuan-Canh/frontend-app-authoring/commits/5ce61fa5e5fed8a481ef6f767e46277c4775d6c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T21:33:59Z","email":"kyle@axim.org","name":"Kyle McCormick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T21:33:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add ability to create Legacy Libraries (#2551)\n\nThis adds a CreateLegacyLibrary component. It functions the same as\nCreateLibrary, but it calls the V1 (legacy) creation REST API rather the V2\n(new/beta) REST API.\n\nThis reinstates, in the MFE, something that was possible using the legacy\nfrontend until it was prematurely removed by\nhttps://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/pull/37454. \n\nWe plan to re-remove this ability between Ulmo and Verawood as part of:\nhttps://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/issues/32457.\nSo, we have intentionally avoided factoring out common logic between\nCreateLibrary and CreateLegacyLibrary, ensuring that the latter\nremains easy to remove and clean up.","tree":{"sha":"678c1c9c0ff5b72ace6f106b2083dac6c22150bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Tuan-Canh/frontend-app-authoring/git/trees/678c1c9c0ff5b72ace6f106b2083dac6c22150bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nguyen-Tuan-Canh/frontend-app-authoring/git/commits/5ce61fa5e5fed8a481ef6f767e46277c4775d6c6","verification":{"payload":"tree 678c1c9c0ff5b72ace6f106b2083dac6c22150bb\nparent 46fa17ea83ebc1efdac3936c7b3c1aa0fbb53d48\nauthor Kyle McCormick <kyle@axim.org> 1761168839 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1761168839 +0000\n\nfeat: Add ability to create Legacy Libraries (#2551)\n\nThis adds a CreateLegacyLibrary component. It functions the same as\nCreateLibrary, but it calls the V1 (legacy) creation REST API rather the V2\n(new/beta) REST API.\n\nThis reinstates, in the MFE, something that was possible using the legacy\nfrontend until it was prematurely removed by\nhttps://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/pull/37454. \n\nWe plan to re-remove this ability between Ulmo and Verawood as part of:\nhttps://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/issues/32457.\nSo, we have intentionally avoided factoring out common logic between\nCreateLibrary and CreateLegacyLibrary, ensuring that the latter\nremains easy to remove and clean up.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo+U3HCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0YYQAAIBP+3q/TpNHKf3gYA3XCmk\nD+CDUjfJg4/jhU2JAgoCLetnBXTcOaSQLKS7UbQDb+e6wWsnncahTMyJqk2b8z1O\nqsGrqiWJ8VWRiiCxgDnjN9qrPH1swvE8RI4Pj0YZSD6ApSAx+7C0n8nWUcOnjDrm\ng6bVoPudwQWNYefUjLAb/QGQ3MjWBMjAz5+iau7boi++sJB7jo3sE9NXZktu0oFC\nYb4BcfMv2WFxGquewEieXP2nUxcs6rx+WGymKjlS6H96No3Y68ZNAE4Y77zSJKLz\n41l8inbMb1qbL1uhFXI1WZK741p//JybAr1q3rcnMWLRnUodeVPzyhceC3/nDOqL\nHB65fHMyHk5RPgy3B4DL/8NnxnmdFoIT/ejpELmaL/KIBS8LsDzXE9XQHYHfXbiG\n/TsOa3aSuy1qe2eqZjbARL0duNqDlt1h6JR1/OmXPC7N5AyIn+4Z7PDdhbkFyyXr\nMjB+RuGFJ2g+9USWn+G5uCvBWpqNXFeYOMJZa5TvaKc+2Iph81MWRWO8o8uhH7H9\n6bUlcNe0lQazMmWBwM8rZ3zAk+hO5VCpAnNS/R+mS0gSy0v8d3Bd7H7I3rF5hf7e\nPrCq1D5zHKt2tFJNIaEntIoUH2xJ/c1ytC9PpOI8DNitxtVCAzzHEqQ9mIb0VVHO\nf1KepwOXBfpddgmyiiJG\n=etu/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-08T16:46:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: